    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Your Units, Build Your Strategy, and Defend!</strong><br><br><strong>Seal the corrupted crystal while fending off endless waves of invading enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources and summon ally units to defeat increasingly powerful foes.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/502ca5d4f6b21671318fadfa3e240a9e.poster.avif?t=1752834599\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/502ca5d4f6b21671318fadfa3e240a9e.webm?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/502ca5d4f6b21671318fadfa3e240a9e.mp4?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block entrances with walls or use sturdy units to hold back enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/3f4db7de1690474831b9cdc1e68bc687.poster.avif?t=1752834599\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/3f4db7de1690474831b9cdc1e68bc687.webm?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/3f4db7de1690474831b9cdc1e68bc687.mp4?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance items to make your units even stronger.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/923b1a7ae636b07dcb1abf5e8439825f.poster.avif?t=1752834599\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/923b1a7ae636b07dcb1abf5e8439825f.webm?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/923b1a7ae636b07dcb1abf5e8439825f.mp4?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn powerful skills to quickly annihilate your enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/1d021159095ec437835ddcbaa91cd10d.poster.avif?t=1752834599\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/1d021159095ec437835ddcbaa91cd10d.webm?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/1d021159095ec437835ddcbaa91cd10d.mp4?t=1752834599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own unique strategy to complete your mission!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077090/extras/e21dde0ea69b412a1985a2fbe241daf8.poster.avif?t=1752834599\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https